     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"text-align:left\">I&#39;m beginner in java and renjin. <br>I need my output result (B) show in my jtextpane(A), How I can do that? I&#39;m so tired. <br>If you know how to do it, please tell me. <br>thanks<br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lcxjt_aXgig/WayE61dyc7I/AAAAAAAAANA/BJtnSQpX_D8Xmmy9bV3ZgIH1W7zjJL8LACLcBGAs/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lcxjt_aXgig/WayE61dyc7I/AAAAAAAAANA/BJtnSQpX_D8Xmmy9bV3ZgIH1W7zjJL8LACLcBGAs/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343499009000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1modS86DLgIG7x5hM89RG1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-lcxjt_aXgig/WayE61dyc7I/AAAAAAAAANA/BJtnSQpX_D8Xmmy9bV3ZgIH1W7zjJL8LACLcBGAs/s1600/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a><br></div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "yvDuKxfZAgAJ",
   "from": "Alexander Bertram",
   "author": "f06db63329fab1f9",
   "date": "2017-09-04T08:24:57Z",
   "subject": "Re: Output Renjin",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>Hi Delin,</div><div><br></div><div>Unfortunately, the <a href=\"https://github.com/cran/e1071/blob/master/R/svm.R#L521\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cran/e1071/blob/master/R/svm.R%23L521&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343499011000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bULc3rRY2IsVNXHPVVM58\">print.svm</a> function always returns NULL, so you won&#39;t be able to get what you want by looking at the return value of print(), it will always be NULL.&#39;</div><div><br></div><div>Instead, the print() function will simply output the text you&#39;ve circled as &quot;B&quot; to the ScriptEngine&#39;s standard output stream, which is by default sent to the process&#39; standard output stream</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve added a section to our documentation on how to do this:</div><div><a href=\"http://docs.renjin.org/en/latest/library/capture.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.renjin.org/en/latest/library/capture.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343499011000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35ivL0IG8DRLInxsryE8Cq\">http://docs.renjin.org/en/latest/library/capture.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>You can redirect the output from R to a StringWriter this way:</div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Incosolata,Consolata,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;background:rgb(246,245,245);padding:12px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(64,64,64)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">StringWriter</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">outputWriter</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">new</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">StringWriter</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">();</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">getContext</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">().</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">setWriter</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">outputWriter</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">);</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">eval</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;print(svmfit)&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">);</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">String</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">output</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">outputWriter</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">toString</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">();</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">// Reset output to console</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">engine</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">getContext</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">().</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">setWriter</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">new</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">PrintWriter</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">System</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">.</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:teal\">out</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">));</span></pre></div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps,</div><div>Alex</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
