     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Sep 4, 2017 at 12:42 AM delin &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">panggi...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div></div>"
